sh about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Using Modals to Express Preferences About Food"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could, would,</span> and  <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to express preferences about food.<br/>You ask questions with modals like <span class=\"italic\">Would you like to \u2026 ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Should we \u2026 ?</span><br/>You can use the short form of would in an answer, like <span class=\"italic\">I'd like to \u2026</span><br/>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Answers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you like to \u2026 ? <br/>Should we \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, I'd like/love to \u2026 <br/>No, I would prefer to \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you come?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes. I would like to.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Andrew</span>: Would you like to eat Thai food tonight?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Beth</span>: Yes! I'd love to try a new restaurant.<br/>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Andrew</span>: Should we make a reservation at Thai Basil? Could you meet me at 7?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Beth</span>: I don't feel like eating Thai. I would prefer to eat Japanese food.<br/>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to go out "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to leave the house"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to go out tonight. Let's eat at Thai Basil!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about going out for dinner."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "downtown"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the center of the city"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many good places to eat downtown."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "how about \u2026"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what do you think about \u2026"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How about eating Thai tonight?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to feel like"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to want to do something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really feel like eating Thai tonight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cheesecake"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in North America, a popular cake made with cream cheese"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is this new cheesecake place downtown. Let's go!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dessert"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sweet food served at the end of a meal"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Dessert is my favorite part of a meal!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reservation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get a table before you go to a restaurant"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We really should make a reservation at Thai Basil."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le01ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le01ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue about going out to a restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about your favorite food. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Express your preferences about food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one restaurant you both agree on."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying the dialogue aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I express preference when I talk about food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about going out to a restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about food."}]}], "type": "sena"}